# Minimal single-triangle fixture with NO texture coordinates at all -
# exercises DecodeMeshOBJ's texcoord_index == -1 fallback path (uv
# defaults to (0,0)), which pyramid.obj (every face corner has a vt)
# never exercises. Also serves as a second, distinct valid mesh asset
# for the "distinct meshes get distinct AssetIds" test.

v 0.0 0.0 0.0
v 1.0 0.0 0.0
v 0.0 1.0 0.0

f 1 2 3
